-500 bg-[#FF6B00] px-6 py-[0.35rem] text-center text-[#f4f4f4] hover:bg-[#f4f4f4] hover:text-[#242424]" tabindex="0"><span>Tickets</span></a></div><ul class="nav__list" role="menubar" aria-label="Hoofdnavigatie"><!--[--><li class="nav__list__item"><a href="/nl/" class="top-level-link" role="menuitem" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false">Missie</a></li><li class="nav__list__item"><a href="/nl/magazine" class="top-level-link" role="menuitem" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false">Magazine</a></li><li class="nav__list__item"><a href="/nl/museum/on-show" class="top-level-link" role="menuitem" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false">Museum</a></li><li class="nav__list__item"><a href="/nl/meetings/plan-your-event" class="top-level-link" role="menuitem" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false">Meetings</a></li><!--]--><li class="nav__list__item"><a href="/nl/shop" class="" role="menuitem">Shop</a></li></ul></div><!----></nav><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--><!--]--><span data-v-d82cdd54></span><div id="scroll-container" data-v-d82cdd54><div class="page-content" data-v-d82cdd54><!--[--><div><main class="main-content"><section class="visual-banner"><img data-nuxt-img sizes="1200px" srcset="https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/783e1342ac-1745328583/next-nature-museum-360x.webp 360w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/783e1342ac-1745328583/next-nature-museum-480x.webp 480w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/783e1342ac-1745328583/next-nature-museum-640x.webp 640w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/783e1342ac-1745328583/next-nature-museum-768x.webp 768w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/783e1342ac-1745328583/next-nature-museum-960x.webp 960w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/783e1342ac-1745328583/next-nature-museum-1024x.webp 1024w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/783e1342ac-1745328583/next-nature-museum-1280x.webp 1280w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/783e1342ac-1745328583/next-nature-museum-1536x.webp 1536w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/783e1342ac-1745328583/next-nature-museum-1920x.webp 1920w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/783e1342ac-1745328583/next-nature-museum-2560x.webp 2560w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/783e1342ac-1745328583/next-nature-museum-3840x.webp 3840w" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt class="full-width" style="object-position:;" fetchpriority="high" src="/_ipx/w_2400&amp;f_webp&amp;q_80/https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/783e1342ac-1745328583/next-nature-museum.jpg"><div class="visual-content"><h1>Evoluon na 30 jaar weer open voor iedereen</h1></div></section><!----><section class="page-content"><div class="page-layout" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section id="fde7bf10-f918-4d8a-af81-2ea54968de6a" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;margin-bottom:;margin-top:;" class="kirby-grid background-wrapper" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><div class="column column_cls_12 first-on-mobile" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;--columns:12;overflow:;height:auto;" data-v-501ddba7><div class="blocks" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section class="text-type-class"><div class="left-align"><p>Het Evoluon en het Next Nature Museum delen een gemeenschappelijke missie: het verbinden van mens, technologie en de toekomst.</p><p>Waar het Evoluon sinds de opening in 1966 symbool staat voor technologische vooruitgang, zet het Next Nature Museum deze traditie voort met vernieuwende exposities over de relatie tussen mens en technologie. De overeenkomst tussen beide is het stimuleren van een toekomstgerichte blik en het uitdagen van bezoekers om na te denken over de wereld van morgen.</p><p>Samen vormen het Evoluon en het Next Nature Museum een unieke plek waar het verleden, heden en de toekomst van technologie weer tot leven komen.</p></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></section><section id="0c40a3ed-5ed8-4f88-85fe-632ba71e8982" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;margin-bottom:;margin-top:;" class="kirby-grid background-wrapper" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><div class="column column_cls_12 first-on-mobile" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;--columns:12;overflow:;height:auto;" data-v-501ddba7><div class="blocks" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section class="heading" data-v-21adef4f><h3 class="left-align" data-v-21adef4f>Beleef de toekomst in een historisch monument: bezoek het Next Nature Museum</h3></section><section class="text-type-class"><div class="left-align"><p>In het Evoluon vind je het Next Nature Museum: een plek waar technologie, natuur en mens samenkomen. Onze tentoonstellingen en installaties nodigen je uit om op een speelse, prikkelende en soms confronterende manier na te denken over de toekomst van het leven op aarde. Of je nu geïnteresseerd bent in AI, biotechnologie, speculatief design of gewoon nieuwsgierig bent naar wat komen gaat - er is altijd iets dat je perspectief uitdaagt.</p></div></section><!--[--><section class="size-undefined block-link-button" data-v-a2f0942f><div class="button-container left-align" data-v-a2f0942f><a href="/nl/museum/on-show" class="button-link orange" style="--btn-bg:#EA6506;--btn-text:#F4F4F4;--btn-hover:#242424;" data-v-a2f0942f><p style="font-weight: inherit;" class="button-content rounded-full px-6 py-2" data-v-a2f0942f>Bezoek het museum</p></a></div></section><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--><!--]--><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></section><section id="acb3039c-df08-47cd-8cda-d2866400cc12" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;margin-bottom:;margin-top:;" class="kirby-grid background-wrapper" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><div class="column column_cls_12 first-on-mobile" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;--columns:12;overflow:;height:auto;" data-v-501ddba7><div class="blocks" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section class="heading" data-v-21adef4f><h3 class="left-align" data-v-21adef4f>Een iconische locatie voor spraakmakende events: organiseer jouw event in het Evoluon</h3></section><section class="text-type-class"><div class="left-align"><p>Het Evoluon is niet alleen een museum - het is ook een van de meest iconische evenementenlocaties van Eindhoven! Van congressen tot productlanceringen: onze indrukwekkende architectuur en flexibele ruimtes bieden een unieke setting voor jouw evenement. Of je nu iets kleins of groots organiseert, wij helpen je om het onvergetelijk te maken. </p></div></section><!--[--><section class="size-undefined block-link-button" data-v-a2f0942f><div class="button-container left-align" data-v-a2f0942f><a href="/nl/meetings/plan-your-event" class="button-link purple" style="--btn-bg:#6c55FE;--btn-text:#F4F4F4;--btn-hover:#242424;" data-v-a2f0942f><p style="font-weight: inherit;" class="button-content rounded-full px-6 py-2" data-v-a2f0942f>Ontdek de mogelijkheden</p></a></div></section><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--><!--]--><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></section><section id="69f2fe45-d5ce-4000-bae3-8c4171afb86f" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;margin-bottom:;margin-top:;" class="kirby-grid background-wrapper" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><div class="column column_cls_12 first-on-mobile" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;--columns:12;overflow:;height:auto;" data-v-501ddba7><div class="blocks" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section class="heading" data-v-21adef4f><h3 class="left-align" data-v-21adef4f>Geef vorm aan de toekomst: steun onze missie</h3></section><section class="text-type-class"><div class="left-align"><p>Next Nature heeft als missie om het gesprek aan te wakkeren over de toekomst van de mensheid en technologie. Als supporter or partner help je mee om onze tentoonstellingen, educatieve programma's en culturele events mogelijk te maken. Jouw steun zorgt ervoor dat het Evoluon een plek blijft voor verbeelding, dialoog en innovatie.</p></div></section><!--[--><section class="size-undefined block-link-button" data-v-a2f0942f><div class="button-container left-align" data-v-a2f0942f><a href="/nl/mission/support-us" class="button-link orange" style="--btn-bg:#EA6506;--btn-text:#F4F4F4;--btn-hover:#242424;" data-v-a2f0942f><p style="font-weight: inherit;" class="button-content rounded-full px-6 py-2" data-v-a2f0942f>Steun Next Nature</p></a></div></section><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--><!--]--><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></section><section id="101a1290-0bd9-4bda-af00-2f3a191ba838" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;margin-bottom:2rem;margin-top:2rem;" class="kirby-grid background-wrapper" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><div class="column column_cls_12 first-on-mobile" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;--columns:12;overflow:;height:auto;" data-v-501ddba7><div class="blocks" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section class="image-class image-class-hero" style="width:100vw !important;max-width:100vw !important;height:50vh;"><figure style="aspect-ratio:auto;" class="relative"><!----><img width="2000" height="1334" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/311451283f-1745328714/evabloem_venuenl_evoluon-003-360x.webp 360w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/311451283f-1745328714/evabloem_venuenl_evoluon-003-480x.webp 480w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/311451283f-1745328714/evabloem_venuenl_evoluon-003-640x.webp 640w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/311451283f-1745328714/evabloem_venuenl_evoluon-003-768x.webp 768w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/311451283f-1745328714/evabloem_venuenl_evoluon-003-960x.webp 960w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/311451283f-1745328714/evabloem_venuenl_evoluon-003-1024x.webp 1024w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/311451283f-1745328714/evabloem_venuenl_evoluon-003-1280x.webp 1280w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/311451283f-1745328714/evabloem_venuenl_evoluon-003-1536x.webp 1536w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/311451283f-1745328714/evabloem_venuenl_evoluon-003-1920x.webp 1920w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/311451283f-1745328714/evabloem_venuenl_evoluon-003-2560x.webp 2560w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/311451283f-1745328714/evabloem_venuenl_evoluon-003-3840x.webp 3840w" onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" alt style="object-fit:cover;" class="" src="/_ipx/q_80&amp;s_2000x1334/https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/311451283f-1745328714/evabloem_venuenl_evoluon-003.jpg"><!----></figure></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></section><section id="cc386021-49eb-4ddd-952b-1c10e4f70689" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;margin-bottom:;margin-top:;" class="kirby-grid background-wrapper" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><div class="column column_cls_12 first-on-mobile" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;--columns:12;overflow:;height:auto;" data-v-501ddba7><div class="blocks" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section class="heading" data-v-21adef4f><h2 class="left-align" data-v-21adef4f>De historie van het Evoluon: iconisch technologiecentrum in Eindhoven</h2></section><section class="text-type-class"><div class="left-align"><p>Het Evoluon, een futuristisch ogend gebouw in Eindhoven, werd in 1966 geopend door Philips als een educatief technologie- en wetenschapsmuseum. Met zijn opvallende, vliegende-schotelachtige ontwerp – bedacht door architecten Louis Kalff en Leo de Bever – werd het al snel een icoon van innovatie.</p><p>In 1989 sloot het Evoluon zijn deuren als publiek museum. Sindsdien heeft het gebouw verschillende functies gehad: zo kon je jarenlang het gebouw bezoeken in de functie van congrescentrum en evenementenlocatie. In 2022 werd de vliegende schotel dan uiteindelijk opnieuw opengesteld voor publiek door Next Nature. Daardoor is het Evoluon vandaag de dag niet enkel een historisch monument, maar ook weer diezelfde inspirerende plek waar men kan leren over technologie en wetenschap. In het Next Nature Museum worden bezoekers geïnspireerd met interactieve tentoonstellingen over innovatie, wetenschap en duurzaamheid.</p></div></section><section class="accordion-type-class"><div class="accordion"><!--[--><div class="accordion__item ac_full_img"><div class="accordion__header" data-id="0a458f0a-710a-479f-a963-18bc3959661c"><div class="accordion_header_wrapper"><!----><button class="block_button" style=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="8" height="18" viewBox="0 0 8 18" fill="none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.63282 0.357965L7.71985 8.1358C8.09338 8.61308 8.09338 9.38692 7.71985 9.8642L1.63282 17.642C1.25929 18.1193 0.653678 18.1193 0.280148 17.642C-0.0933826 17.1647 -0.0933826 16.3909 0.280148 15.9136L5.60879 9.10485V8.89515L0.280148 2.08637C-0.0933826 1.60909 -0.0933826 0.835251 0.280148 0.357965C0.653678 -0.119322 1.25929 -0.119322 1.63282 0.357965Z" fill="white"></path></svg></button><button class="block_button" style="display:none;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="10" viewBox="0 0 16 10" fill="none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.6818 2.04103L8.76818 9.64982C8.34393 10.1167 7.65607 10.1167 7.23182 9.64982L0.318191 2.04103C-0.106062 1.57411 -0.106062 0.817097 0.318192 0.350184C0.742447 -0.116729 1.4303 -0.116729 1.85455 0.350184L7.9068 7.01099L8.0932 7.01099L14.1454 0.350185C14.5697 -0.116728 15.2576 -0.116728 15.6818 0.350185C16.1061 0.817098 16.1061 1.57411 15.6818 2.04103Z" fill="white"></path></svg></button><div class="header_text"><div class="text_header"><h4>1966: de opening van het Evoluon</h4></div></div></div></div><section class="accordion__body grid" style=""><div class="page-layout" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section id="51aa4615-3268-45fc-8695-2ca178c6bcf1" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;margin-bottom:;margin-top:;" class="kirby-grid background-wrapper" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><div class="column column_cls_12" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;--columns:12;overflow:;height:auto;" data-v-501ddba7><div class="blocks" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section class="text-type-class"><div class="left-align"><p>Philips opent het Evoluon in Eindhoven als een educatief technologie- en wetenschapsmuseum, ter ere van het 75-jarig bestaan van het bedrijf. Het futuristische, schotelvormige gebouw is ontworpen door Louis Kalff en Leo de Bever.</p></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></section><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="accordion__item ac_full_img"><div class="accordion__header" data-id="2f9d87b0-1d24-4d0a-aed9-d6f631223a82"><div class="accordion_header_wrapper"><!----><button class="block_button" style=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="8" height="18" viewBox="0 0 8 18" fill="none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.63282 0.357965L7.71985 8.1358C8.09338 8.61308 8.09338 9.38692 7.71985 9.8642L1.63282 17.642C1.25929 18.1193 0.653678 18.1193 0.280148 17.642C-0.0933826 17.1647 -0.0933826 16.3909 0.280148 15.9136L5.60879 9.10485V8.89515L0.280148 2.08637C-0.0933826 1.60909 -0.0933826 0.835251 0.280148 0.357965C0.653678 -0.119322 1.25929 -0.119322 1.63282 0.357965Z" fill="white"></path></svg></button><button class="block_button" style="display:none;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="10" viewBox="0 0 16 10" fill="none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.6818 2.04103L8.76818 9.64982C8.34393 10.1167 7.65607 10.1167 7.23182 9.64982L0.318191 2.04103C-0.106062 1.57411 -0.106062 0.817097 0.318192 0.350184C0.742447 -0.116729 1.4303 -0.116729 1.85455 0.350184L7.9068 7.01099L8.0932 7.01099L14.1454 0.350185C14.5697 -0.116728 15.2576 -0.116728 15.6818 0.350185C16.1061 0.817098 16.1061 1.57411 15.6818 2.04103Z" fill="white"></path></svg></button><div class="header_text"><div class="text_header"><h4>1989: de sluiting van het museum</h4></div></div></div></div><section class="accordion__body grid" style=""><div class="page-layout" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section id="51aa4615-3268-45fc-8695-2ca178c6bcf1" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;margin-bottom:;margin-top:;" class="kirby-grid background-wrapper" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><div class="column column_cls_12" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;--columns:12;overflow:;height:auto;" data-v-501ddba7><div class="blocks" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section class="text-type-class"><div class="left-align"><p>Het Evoluon sluit zijn deuren als publieksmuseum vanwege teruglopende bezoekersaantallen en veranderende inzichten over wetenschapscommunicatie.</p></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></section><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="accordion__item ac_full_img"><div class="accordion__header" data-id="fefd0575-c590-48a5-b1ec-d0be41ddff8f"><div class="accordion_header_wrapper"><!----><button class="block_button" style=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="8" height="18" viewBox="0 0 8 18" fill="none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.63282 0.357965L7.71985 8.1358C8.09338 8.61308 8.09338 9.38692 7.71985 9.8642L1.63282 17.642C1.25929 18.1193 0.653678 18.1193 0.280148 17.642C-0.0933826 17.1647 -0.0933826 16.3909 0.280148 15.9136L5.60879 9.10485V8.89515L0.280148 2.08637C-0.0933826 1.60909 -0.0933826 0.835251 0.280148 0.357965C0.653678 -0.119322 1.25929 -0.119322 1.63282 0.357965Z" fill="white"></path></svg></button><button class="block_button" style="display:none;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="10" viewBox="0 0 16 10" fill="none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.6818 2.04103L8.76818 9.64982C8.34393 10.1167 7.65607 10.1167 7.23182 9.64982L0.318191 2.04103C-0.106062 1.57411 -0.106062 0.817097 0.318192 0.350184C0.742447 -0.116729 1.4303 -0.116729 1.85455 0.350184L7.9068 7.01099L8.0932 7.01099L14.1454 0.350185C14.5697 -0.116728 15.2576 -0.116728 15.6818 0.350185C16.1061 0.817098 16.1061 1.57411 15.6818 2.04103Z" fill="white"></path></svg></button><div class="header_text"><div class="text_header"><h4>1998: het Evoluon wordt een congrescentrum</h4></div></div></div></div><section class="accordion__body grid" style=""><div class="page-layout" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section id="51aa4615-3268-45fc-8695-2ca178c6bcf1" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;margin-bottom:;margin-top:;" class="kirby-grid background-wrapper" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><div class="column column_cls_12" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;--columns:12;overflow:;height:auto;" data-v-501ddba7><div class="blocks" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section class="text-type-class"><div class="left-align"><p>Na jaren van beperkt gebruik krijgt het Evoluon een nieuwe functie als conferentie- en evenementenlocatie, waar bedrijven en organisaties bijeenkomsten kunnen organiseren.</p></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></section><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="accordion__item ac_full_img"><div class="accordion__header" data-id="4567668e-e80f-4c12-a93b-a3dbf880ec8c"><div class="accordion_header_wrapper"><!----><button class="block_button" style=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="8" height="18" viewBox="0 0 8 18" fill="none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.63282 0.357965L7.71985 8.1358C8.09338 8.61308 8.09338 9.38692 7.71985 9.8642L1.63282 17.642C1.25929 18.1193 0.653678 18.1193 0.280148 17.642C-0.0933826 17.1647 -0.0933826 16.3909 0.280148 15.9136L5.60879 9.10485V8.89515L0.280148 2.08637C-0.0933826 1.60909 -0.0933826 0.835251 0.280148 0.357965C0.653678 -0.119322 1.25929 -0.119322 1.63282 0.357965Z" fill="white"></path></svg></button><button class="block_button" style="display:none;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="10" viewBox="0 0 16 10" fill="none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.6818 2.04103L8.76818 9.64982C8.34393 10.1167 7.65607 10.1167 7.23182 9.64982L0.318191 2.04103C-0.106062 1.57411 -0.106062 0.817097 0.318192 0.350184C0.742447 -0.116729 1.4303 -0.116729 1.85455 0.350184L7.9068 7.01099L8.0932 7.01099L14.1454 0.350185C14.5697 -0.116728 15.2576 -0.116728 15.6818 0.350185C16.1061 0.817098 16.1061 1.57411 15.6818 2.04103Z" fill="white"></path></svg></button><div class="header_text"><div class="text_header"><h4>2022: publieke heropening door Next Nature</h4></div></div></div></div><section class="accordion__body grid" style=""><div class="page-layout" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section id="51aa4615-3268-45fc-8695-2ca178c6bcf1" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;margin-bottom:;margin-top:;" class="kirby-grid background-wrapper" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><div class="column column_cls_12" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;--columns:12;overflow:;height:auto;" data-v-501ddba7><div class="blocks" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section class="text-type-class"><div class="left-align"><p>Iedereen is het erover eens: het iconische Evoluon moet in ere worden hersteld en opnieuw een publieksfunctie krijgen. Next Nature opent de deuren en geeft het Evoluon terug aan het grote publiek. Het Next Nature Museum biedt interactieve tentoonstellingen over technologie, toekomst en duurzaamheid, in lijn met de oorspronkelijke missie van Philips.</p></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></section><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="accordion__item ac_full_img"><div class="accordion__header" data-id="00cb9e4a-1b1d-4801-820a-e6153040a856"><div class="accordion_header_wrapper"><!----><button class="block_button" style=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="8" height="18" viewBox="0 0 8 18" fill="none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.63282 0.357965L7.71985 8.1358C8.09338 8.61308 8.09338 9.38692 7.71985 9.8642L1.63282 17.642C1.25929 18.1193 0.653678 18.1193 0.280148 17.642C-0.0933826 17.1647 -0.0933826 16.3909 0.280148 15.9136L5.60879 9.10485V8.89515L0.280148 2.08637C-0.0933826 1.60909 -0.0933826 0.835251 0.280148 0.357965C0.653678 -0.119322 1.25929 -0.119322 1.63282 0.357965Z" fill="white"></path></svg></button><button class="block_button" style="display:none;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="10" viewBox="0 0 16 10" fill="none"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.6818 2.04103L8.76818 9.64982C8.34393 10.1167 7.65607 10.1167 7.23182 9.64982L0.318191 2.04103C-0.106062 1.57411 -0.106062 0.817097 0.318192 0.350184C0.742447 -0.116729 1.4303 -0.116729 1.85455 0.350184L7.9068 7.01099L8.0932 7.01099L14.1454 0.350185C14.5697 -0.116728 15.2576 -0.116728 15.6818 0.350185C16.1061 0.817098 16.1061 1.57411 15.6818 2.04103Z" fill="white"></path></svg></button><div class="header_text"><div class="text_header"><h4>Vandaag: Evoluon en Next Nature als icoon van innovatie</h4></div></div></div></div><section class="accordion__body grid" style=""><div class="page-layout" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section id="51aa4615-3268-45fc-8695-2ca178c6bcf1" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;margin-bottom:;margin-top:;" class="kirby-grid background-wrapper" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><div class="column column_cls_12" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;--columns:12;overflow:;height:auto;" data-v-501ddba7><div class="blocks" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section class="text-type-class"><div class="left-align"><p>Het Evoluon en het Next Nature Museum vormen samen een inspirerende plek waar technologie, mens en natuur samenkomen. Het historische gebouw, gecombineerd met vernieuwende exposities en evenementen, blijft een symbool van vooruitgang.</p></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></section><!--]--></div></section></div><!--]--></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></section><section id="8a459072-7a01-4346-ac8f-c1cf212c6359" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;margin-bottom:;margin-top:2rem;" class="kirby-grid background-wrapper" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><div class="column column_cls_12 first-on-mobile" style="background-color:transparent;color:#F4F4F4;--custom-color:#F4F4F4;--columns:12;overflow:;height:auto;" data-v-501ddba7><div class="blocks" data-v-501ddba7><!--[--><section class="image-class image-class-hero" style="width:100vw !important;max-width:100vw !important;height:50vh;"><figure style="aspect-ratio:auto;" class="relative"><!----><img width="2000" height="1334" data-nuxt-img srcset="https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/27e2e03f3d-1745329167/20240630_nextnature1142-360x.webp 360w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/27e2e03f3d-1745329167/20240630_nextnature1142-480x.webp 480w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/27e2e03f3d-1745329167/20240630_nextnature1142-640x.webp 640w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/27e2e03f3d-1745329167/20240630_nextnature1142-768x.webp 768w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/27e2e03f3d-1745329167/20240630_nextnature1142-960x.webp 960w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/27e2e03f3d-1745329167/20240630_nextnature1142-1024x.webp 1024w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/27e2e03f3d-1745329167/20240630_nextnature1142-1280x.webp 1280w, https://cms.nextnature.net/media/pages/museum/evoluon/27e2e03f3d-1745329167/20240630_nextna